AI art generators?",a:"NovelAI specializes in making AI anime art creation easy with natural language prompting and tagging, offering easy character consistency and precise control. You can easily manipulate prompts, adjust character positioning, use action tags, and define characters separately to maintain consistency across scenes. You have the ability to define exactly what they are supposed to be doing, separately. NovelAI removes hardware barriers—accessible from your mobile device with fast generation speeds and no installation required."},2:{q:"Is my privacy really protected when using NovelAI?",a:"Yes, privacy is fundamental to NovelAI. We offer complete anonymity - you can generate images using AI without linking any personal information. Your prompts are encrypted and all generated images are never stored on our servers (they only exist during your session unless you choose to save them), and we don't track or monitor your creative process. You have full control over your work and privacy."},3:{q:"Can I use NovelAI's generated images however I want?",a:"Yes, you have complete freedom to use your AI anime art as you wish. Unlike other services there are no limitations on commercial use, you do not need to purchase any additional subscription tiers either. Whether it's for personal projects, commercial work, or any other purpose, making NovelAI ideal for artists, content creators, and storytellers looking to bring their ideas to life."},4:{q:"How much does NovelAI cost, and what do I get?",a:"Our subscriptions start at $10/month, perfect for casual creators with access to both our AI anime image generator and text generator. While we're not a free AI image generator, our subscription model ensures we can provide high-quality service without compromising on features. New users can try our platform through our trial period to experience the full capabilities or if you don't want to worry about a monthly subscription, you can use the on-demand Anlas purchasing option to fuel your image generation capabilities!"},5:{q:"How can I edit and refine my generated images?",a:"NovelAI offers powerful editing tools to perfect your AI anime art. Our inpainting feature lets you selectively modify specific areas - from adjusting facial features to completely changing backgrounds. With Director Tools you can enhance details, modify clothing, adjust lighting, or even change character poses while maintaining the overall style and quality. We also offer a built in canvas for quick on the spot edits to guide the AI along to paint your art, just how you envision it!"},6:{q:"How can I get started with NovelAI?",a:"Getting started is easy. Simply register with your email address and you will be able to sign in and try our generator. Our interface is designed to be intuitive while giving you full creative control. You'll have immediate access to our features from the moment you begin."}},anlasExplanation:"Anlas are a form of digital currency used to enhance your image generation experience for things like higher resolutions, faster generation times, and more.",exploreOurPlans:"Explore\nOur Plans",learnMoreAboutVibeTransfer:"Learn more about Vibe Transfer",landingModeButtons:{homepage:"Homepage",images:"Images",stories:"Stories",pricing:"Pricing"},landingTopImage:{title:{0:"The world's most powerful",1:"anime AI image generator."},subtitle:"Generate original characters, scenes, and artwork in seconds. No restrictions. No compromises.",cta:"Start Generating for Free"},landingTopText:{title:{0:"An AI that writes with you,",1:"not for you."},subtitle:"Build stories, worlds, and characters with an AI that writes with you — not for you.",cta:"Start Writing for Free"},landingTopCombined:{titleImage:{0:"Crate stunning",1:"Anime Art with AI"},titleText:{0:"Write worlds",1:"that remember everything"},subtitleImage:"Bring your ideas to life — no limits, no compromises, and no drawing skills needed.",subtitleText:"Build stories, worlds, and characters wit