art Creating with V5",startCreatingNote:"Both V5 Curated and V5 Full are available today",chips:{0:"6 Languages",1:"2x Detail (32-ch VAE)",2:"Improved BGs",3:"22 Characters/Scene",4:"Full Comic Pages"},whatsDifferent:"What Makes V5 Different?",whatsDifferentSub:"V5 isn’t a big deal because of any single feature. It’s a big deal because of how all of them work together.\nBetter prompt understanding means better compositions. A better VAE means cleaner details and cleaner alpha transparency. And better character positioning means comic generation actually works the way you’d want it to. Every upgrade compounds the others; this is the most refined, most capable model we’ve built.",heresWhatsNew:"Here’s what’s new:",characters:"More Characters & Improved Character Positioning",charactersTagline:"22 characters. One scene.",charactersSub:{0:"V5 renders ",1:"up to 22 distinct characters",2:" in a single scene, with positioning to match. Place characters anywhere on your canvas and V5 follows, giving you greater control over composition."},comics:"Generate Full Comic Pages",comicsTagline:"Full comic pages, zero stitching.",comicsSub:{0:"Describe your panel layout, characters, and composition in natural language, and V5 generates the entire page at once.\nNo more generating panels separately and stitching them together yourself."},imageQuality:"Image Quality",imageQualityTagline:"More channels means more details.",imageQualitySub:{0:"Thanks to the larger model size, improved model architecture, and the new 32-channel VAE, smaller details like eyes, jewelry, text, and accessories are rendered with meaningfully higher accuracy."},backgrounds:"Backgrounds Improved + Transparency",backgroundsTagline:"Better details didn’t stop at the character level.",backgroundsSub:{0:"With V5, environments, architecture, and foliage all render with real detail instead of fading into the backdrop. Plus, adding ",1:"transparent backgrounds",2:" is now effortless."},multiLanguage:"Multi-Language 